@* The drift note (docs/ui/components/Notice): before an act that changes a
   dataset's declaration on the server, passed into ConfirmDialog's note slot.
   Its wording lives here, once, in a part; Notice stays generic. *@
<Notice Title="The declaration will drift from Git" Warn="true">This changes the dataset's declaration on the server. Your declaration files in Git still say otherwise, so the next <code>varve apply</code>, including one run by CI, will undo it unless you change them too. <code>varve apply --plan</code> shows the difference.</Notice>
